Items/v1/","context":{"app_id":5031430,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1847286114042127","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"update","title":"Halloween Update: Haunted Harvest","summary":"New twist: Haunted HarvestThe whole course is swallowed by a cornfield at night. One player becomes the hunter: bigger, faster, wearing a pumpkin and swinging a scythe. Everyone else searches the corn by torchlight for the pumpkins that open the finish, then runs for the flag.Get caught by the scythe and you join the huntA red ring closes in, so nobody can hide in the stalks for everYour heartbeat speeds up when the hunter gets closeEvery so often the hunter can see you through the cornDraw THE ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T15:18:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042127","verified_at":"2026-10-25T16:49:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1846651706686282","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Starts Tomorrow!","summary":"Hey everyone! I Buried Steve is in Steam Next Fest, starting tomorrow! The free demo is live, so grab some friends and come build a beach that's actively trying to kill you. Wishlist GoalsThere's now a community wishlist track in the game. Every time we hit a goal, everyone gets a new reward: 1,000 wishlists: The Roundabout map. We just passed it, thank you! 2,000: the Vortex, the Tennis Ball Launcher and more new traps 3,500: the Breadnaught, a giant bread mech players can drive 10,000: capybar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:30:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686282","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1844751498224157","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"announcement","title":"Seagull Chaos, Tidal Waves & a Secret Boss","summary":"Hey everyone! It's been a big week. I've made a lot of changes, so here's everything that's new.Seagulls Got a Serious UpgradeSpectating as a seagull is now a lot more than just flying around:Fire at players – tap to shoot, or hold right click to charge up a bigger shot that does AoE and messes up their screen even more. Blind indicator – there's a new effect so you can clearly see when you've blinded a player. Chain your shots – hitting players repeatedly obscures their screen more and more. Sp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T11:01:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224157","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1843481262690094","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"announcement","title":"Secret Cards, Lobby Fishing & Seagull Spectators","summary":"New FeaturesSecret Card – During drafting, you can now receive a secret card that other players can't see. Use it wisely. Lobby Fishing – Matches can take a moment to fill in a small indie game, so now you can fish while you wait. There are 20 unique fish to collect. Fish will also randomly jump out of the sea anywhere in the lobby – throw anything at them to catch them. Arcade Machine & Jarla – A mysterious arcade machine has appeared in spawn. Use it to unlock new hat variants and other surpri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T18:09:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1842212951314386","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo System & Balance Overhaul","summary":"Hey all, today I have an update for the demo making some large system changes.Major Gameplay ChangesNew Placed Item: Tiki Idol - Bringing a Tiki Idol to the finish line now awards +5 points.Developer Note: This new mechanic adds a layer of depth, giving players a strategic reason to explore the map instead of rushing straight to the finish line.Solo Scoring Balance - Adjusted solo completion points to match the score awarded for finishing first.Powerup Crate Respawns - Powerup crates now respawn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T18:15:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314386","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1842212951307665","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"announcement","title":"Quickmatch & First Person","summary":"Hey all,Small demo update today! I have added a quickmatch system and new first person visuals, alongside a new shotgun powerup. New Features & SystemsQuickmatch Button: Added matchmaking functionality. This button puts players directly into managed lobbies that do not require host control. These servers are marked with \"Official Rules\" in the lobby browser.Quickfire System: Added a brand-new quickfire system. You can now throw the Bomb Boomerang, Shield, and Snowball instantly without needing t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T14:27:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5031430-1842212951300592","game_id":"steam-5031430","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out now","summary":"Hey all, For the past couple of months I've been building I Buried Steve, and it's finally at the point where other people can play it.The idea is simple. Players take turns picking traps and blocks, and everyone builds a course that only they know how to finish. Then the countdown hits zero and all eight of you run it at once. Add some ridiculous modifiers, proximity voice chat and split screen, and that's the game.What's playable right nowThe full tutorial and all of multiplayer. Every build p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T16:09:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5031430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5031430":"2026-10-26T07:17:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5031430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:09Z"},"5076850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:17:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5031430","app_id":5031430,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ddb128e021dacd9d890f2b00aafe72f5d7ec91eeb5e596c3095877845dbb70ce","respon